{"sections":[{"slug":"结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">性质</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"结构, 性质"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在数学用语中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于一类事物</span> $A$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">说</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结构而非性质</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">意思是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的选取不是唯一的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">不典范</span>”;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">说</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">意思是它只要存在就是唯一的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或者说只有</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">或</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">否</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">两种情形</span>;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦类型论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的话说</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结构</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">就是有高阶</span> ($0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶及以上</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦信息</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的类型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/集合(同伦类型论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">就是</span> $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/命题(同伦类型论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">命题</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">通过截断</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可将结构强行变为性质</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这在数学用于中常常表达为</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">虽然</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是结构而非性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">存在</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一个性质</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这句话的实际含义是取</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\|A\\|$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">模结构与性质</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> “$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构等价于对任意</span> $x \\in M$, $nx=0$. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则这个结构是唯一的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathbb{Z}/n\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构构成</span> $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类型</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> “$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[1/n]$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[1/n]$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构等价于对任意</span> $x \\in M$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $y\\in M$, $x=ny$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> “$M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/p-进整数","text":"$\\mathbb{Z}_p$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结构而非性质</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">直观上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">虽然</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$ <span lang=\"zh\">中稠密</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是拓扑模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们谈论的只是模结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">不能确保</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构唯一</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">事实上</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p\\otimes_{\\mathbb{Z}}\\mathbb{Z}_p$ <span lang=\"zh\">不同构于</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$, <span lang=\"zh\">所以</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p\\otimes_{\\mathbb{Z}}\\mathbb{Z}_p$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有两个不同的</span> $\\mathbb{Z}_p$-<span lang=\"zh\">模结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于环同态</span> $A\\to B$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下条件等价</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">典范的环同态</span> $B\\otimes_A B \\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模构成</span> $B$-<span lang=\"zh\">模是性质</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">遗忘函子</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(B) \\to \\mathsf{Mod}(A)$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/全忠实函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全忠实</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}